<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 100.32 mln rand SA bonds on Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 100.32 mln rand SA bonds on Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 100.32 million rand worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling a net 2.57 million rand the previous day, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
